# Postposed morning daypart words that keep a bare 12-hour clock reading in
# the AM half (meridiem offset 0), the am counterpart of
# clock_meridiem_pm.voc.  "acht uur 's ochtends" == 08:00; only the noon edge
# is rewritten (12 -> 0).  Bands: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale nl
# -- ochtend/morning [06:00, 12:00) is the am half.  ("nachts" is NOT here:
# the night daypart crosses midnight -- see clock_meridiem_night.voc.)
ochtends
morgens
